      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, yes, it is, but while developing it we had the filesystem present, but not really supporting most of the planned features. \u0027corefs\u0027 one did. It is unfortunate to have the devices with this code built in out there, but it is the way Android works",
      "parentUuid": "624a85dc_0dfdd887",
